        "created_at": "2021-04-08T02:36:53.582Z",
        "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>For the Switch green ability, you essentially get the boost and then change forms, is that right? The boost is not in conjunction with the new form but rather precedes it?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Can you have more than two modes?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>What is a green mode and a green form? Does that just mean the green abilities for a specific mode or form?</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-04-08T02:36:53.582Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
