        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "yes, you would get your boost and then switch modes \nyou will have more than one mode but you can only be in one mode at a time \nyou have a default green mode with no special effects\n1 other green mode from the list of 3 \n2 yellow modes from the list of 5\n1 red mode from the list of 3\nThe Form Changer's forms and the Modular's modes basically work the same it changes up your power dice in a way described in the archetype rules and gives you an ability only usable when that option is \"on\"",
